### Get all attractions (HTML page)
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions

### Get one attraction by name (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions/Tivoli

### Get one attraction that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions/Findes%20ikke

### Add an attraction (form data, like the HTML form sends it)
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Rundetaarn&description=Historisk observatorietårn i hjertet af København&address=Købmagergade 52A, 1150 København K&city=KØBENHAVN&tags=ENTRÉ&tags=BØRNEVENLIG

### Update an attraction
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/Rundetaarn/edit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

description=Opdateret beskrivelse&address=Købmagergade 52A, 1150 København K&city=KØBENHAVN&tags=MUSEUM

### Show the tags of an attraction
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions/Rundetaarn/tags

### Delete an attraction
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/Rundetaarn/delete
